   "text": "Same unreliable channel: it can time out too.\nThe uncertainty recurs one level up.",
   "originalText": "Same unreliable channel: it can time out too.\nThe uncertainty recurs one level up.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
