   "text": "A visible, bounded, fixable problem beats an invisible one.\nAim for zero duplicate EFFECTS, not zero duplicate messages.",
   "originalText": "A visible, bounded, fixable problem beats an invisible one.\nAim for zero duplicate EFFECTS, not zero duplicate messages.",
